  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Updating the earthquake hazard map in the Naryn basin - University of Oxford</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. To acquire satellite imagery from which to build high-resolution digital elevation data covering the Naryn hydropower cascade (Fig. 2)
2. To prepare IT facilities in Oxford Dept of Earth Sciences for handling the required large data storage and processing requirements associated with the satellite and elevation data.
3. To write an initial end-user report and recommendations for a 2nd phase project, to be assessed for funding by the World Bank from April 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
